      "assessment": "limitation_retained",
      "reason": "Sixteen authored pairs and repeated measurements on those same pairs do not establish performance across agents, tasks, tools or populations."
    },
    {
      "id": "berkson",
      "title": "Filtered selection",
      "assessment": "limitation_retained",
      "reason": "The matrix deliberately selects paraphrases, summaries, near-overlap controls and ambiguous cases. It is a stress-test design rather than a random deployment sample."
    },
    {
